"07"]},"親が亡くなった後、ありのままを伝え、お別れに立ち会わせ、環境を変えるために他の場所へ送らないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"悲しみから半年経っても立ち直れず、日常生活が送れない場合は、精神科または臨床心理科を受診してください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"いきなり悲嘆カウンセリングにお金を使う前に、自分の悲しみが本当に「停滞」しているかを確認しましょう（第 8 条の症状など）"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"別居・離婚後は健康保険を途切れさせない、お酒で紛らわさない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"話し相手が必要な時は 12356 へ、未成年者・青少年は 12355 へ、医師を求めるなら心理外来へ"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/29-12","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"大きな変化の直後の3ヶ月間は、いかなる不可逆的な重大決定も、すべて後回しにする"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"死を借金返済の手段と考えてはいけない：2年以内の生命保険は不払い、労災も不認定、債務は変わらず遺産から差し押さえられる"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/29"},"children":["第29章"," ·"," ","重大な打撃を受けた後"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"29-12"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["12"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["大きな変化の直後の3ヶ月間は、いかなる不可逆的な重大決定も、すべて後回しにする"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["この時期、あなたはあらゆる「チャンス」に対する判断力が最も低下しています。「亡くなった人と連絡が取れる」「お金を元通りに増やせる」「仕事を辞めて他へ移り住んで再出発しよう」「共同事業をしよう」といった誘いが、次々と舞い込んでくるでしょう。月収を超える金額、あるいは取り返しのつかない代償を伴う事柄は、すべて3ヶ月間先送りにしてください。まずは、その件に関して利害関係のない人に話を聞いてもらい、その日のうちに決断を下さないようにしてください。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりなず、単に決定を先送りにするだけです。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["大きな打撃の直後、判断力が落ちている時期に取り返しのつかない財産処分を避けます。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：大きな変化の直後の3ヶ月間は、いかなる不可逆的な重大決定も、すべて後回しにする"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりなず、単に決定を先送りにするだけです。そのため、一部の機会を逃す可能性があります。難しいのは、その瞬間に「チャンスは待ってくれない」と感じてしまう点です。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["大きな打撃の直後、判断力が落ちている時期に取り返しのつかない財産処分を避けます。住宅売却、退職、遺族給付や賠償金の一括投資、性急な再婚、他人の保証人になることなどです。額は数万元から家1軒ほどになることが多く、利益は「中」とします。中国の公式文書も家庭の変故・失業・退学を地域が積極的に把握する心理危機リスクに挙げ、他者の支援が必要な状態としています。米国国立老化研究所（NIA）の悲嘆の指針は意思決定の難しさをよくある症状とし、可能なら重要な人生の決定を気分がよくなるまで先に延ばすよう勧めています。悲しみで考えがまとまらない間は住宅売却や退職など大きな変更を避けるということです。3実験を含む研究では、無作為に一部の参加者を悲しい気分にし、今受け取るお金か3か月後のお金かを選ばせました。平静な人より、悲しい人は待たないために13%〜34%少ない金額でも受け入れました。これは実験で誘発された悲しみで、実際の死別ではありません。米国連邦取引委員会（FTC）は2023年、葬儀社をかたり「すぐ追加料金を払わないと葬儀を取り消す」という詐欺を警告しました。最初の対策は即決の圧力に屈しないことで、正規の業者は決める時間をくれます。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国家卫生健康委等 25 部门 (2026). 健全社会心理服务体系和危机干预机制实施方案（国卫医政发〔2026〕8 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065035.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065035.htm"]},"；National Institute on Aging. Coping With Grief and Loss（「Postpone major decisions if possible」一段，页面 2026-01-26 更新）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nia.nih.gov/health/grief-and-mourning/coping-grief-and-loss","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nia.nih.gov/health/grief-and-mourning/coping-grief-and-loss"]},"；Lerner JS, Li Y, Weber EU (2013). The financial costs of sadness. Psychological Science, 24(1), 72-79. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0956797612450302","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1177/0956797612450302"]},"；Puig A, Federal Trade Commission (2023-06-15). Imposters prey on families preparing for the funeral of a loved one. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/06/imposters-prey-families-preparing-funeral-loved-one","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/06/imposters-prey-families-preparing-funeral-loved-one"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065035.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["利害関係のない相談相手がいなければ、中国の12356に話すか（本節第11条）、書き出して3日後に読み返します。「先に延ばす」方向は公式の悲嘆指針と無作為実験に支えられるためBです。ただし死別した人が延期する場合としない場合の財産結果を直接比較した研究はありません。NIAも「気分がよくなるまで」とし、期間は指定しません。「3か月」と「月収超」は著者独自の線引きです。遺族や高齢者を狙う詐欺は第17節（老後投資・住宅による老後資金）と第6節（占い）、保証や借用書は第8節を参照してください。住宅積立金の残額、社会保険給付、労災死亡の3給付など、積極的に手続すべきお金は延期の対象ではありません。第25節と第19節を参照してください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/29-11"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"話し相手が必要な時は 12356 へ、未成年者・青少年は 12355 へ、医師を求めるなら心理外来へ"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/29-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"死を借金返済の手段と考えてはいけない：2年以内の生命保険は不払い、労災も不認定、債務は変わらず遺産から差し押さえられる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["配偶者を亡くした後の最初の半年間は、三食、睡眠、持病の薬、そして再検査の管理を、特定の誰かに任せて見守ってもらう"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["配偶者亡き後半年未満の時期は、同時期に死亡する確率が、配偶者を亡くしていない人よりも約4割高いです。半年を過ぎると、その差は約1.5割にま…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["親族も友人もいない場合は、「あなたを見守る存在」を3つのものに置き換えてください：自宅に入れる近隣住民、地域の訪問リスト、スマートフォンの緊急連絡先"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["親族も友人もいないときは、2つのことをケアする必要があります。それは、「何かあった時に誰かに気づいてもらうこと」と、「日頃、決まった時間に…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["親が亡くなった後、ありのままを伝え、お別れに立ち会わせ、環境を変えるために他の場所へ送らないこと"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18 歳で父または母を亡くした子供は、経験していない子供に比べて、成人期までに死亡する確率が約5割高い。親の死因は、不慮の事故や自殺が約8…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["悲しみから半年経っても立ち直れず、日常生活が送れない場合は、精神科または臨床心理科を受診してください"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["大切な人を亡くした成人の約10人に1人が、停滞状態に陥ることがあります。半年以上経っても、食事が喉を通らない、仕事に行けない、育児ができな…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["いきなり悲嘆カウンセリングにお金を使う前に、自分の悲しみが本当に「停滞」しているかを確認しましょう（第 8 条の症状など）"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["大切な人を亡くしたすべての人に心理カウンセリングを勧めることは、メリットが非常に少ないです。なぜなら、ほとんどの人は自然に立ち直っていくた…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/29-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["別居・離婚後は健康保険を途切れさせない、お酒で紛らわさない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["別居や離婚をした人は、婚姻関係が続いている人に比べて早期死亡率が明らかに高く、特に男性や若い世代でその傾向が顕著です。これは必ずしも離婚そ…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/29"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：重大な打撃を受けた後"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","prop